Description: Goodix GXFP5187/GXFP5197 SPI (TLS-PSK) driver "goodixtls"
 Adds the goodixtls driver to libfprint 1.94.9 and lets the generated spidev
 udev rule match ACPI devices that also carry a _CID.
 .
 The driver is Benjamin Allègre's (Sigfrodr) GXFP5187 driver from
 https://github.com/Sigfrodr/libfprint-goodixtls (commit 17354ac,
 LGPL-2.1-or-later), changed in 2026 by Matthias Gruss for the GXFP5197
 (Huawei MateBook D, VLT-W50): split SPI frames, per-model table, PSK address,
 MCU state after the handshake, timing and background handling.
 Changes to libfprint's own files: libfprint/meson.build, meson.build,
 tests/meson.build (driver and tests registered),
 libfprint/fprint-list-udev-rules.c (acpi:HID:* match), 2026, Matthias Gruss.
Author: Matthias Gruss
Origin: https://github.com/fruchtpfote/libfprint-gxfp5197
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-22
---
